    "text": "IT is hereby notified that I, C. Nanda Mathew, Governor of the Uva Province, do hereby announce that, Hon. Chief MinisterShashindra Rajapaksha has been removed, from the post of Chief Minister of Uva Province, with effect from January 14, 2015,who was appointed by me as a Chief Minister of Uva Province with effect from September 30, 2014 by virtue of powers vestedto me under Section 154F (4) of the 13th Amendment to the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.",
